WEBVTT

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:03.140
It's a lie!

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:10.230
Mitsuya-kun is dead!

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:22.170
It's a lie, it's a lie!

00:00:22.310 --> 00:00:23.990
There's no way Mitsuya-kun is dead!

00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:47.790
This is a mistake!

00:00:49.030 --> 00:00:51.260
This can't be happening!

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:02.990
Hina is also dead.

00:01:03.310 --> 00:01:07.320
It's the same again.

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:11.700
Nothing has changed.

00:01:12.650 --> 00:01:14.190
What is this?

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:38.360
Shifu Yato! Where are you?

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:52.550
The key was in front of me.

00:01:52.610 --> 00:01:55.130
It's in the borough apartment.

00:02:09.180 --> 00:02:10.160
The smell of my home...

00:02:10.160 --> 00:02:15.300
Where do I live?

00:02:15.560 --> 00:02:15.820
From the

00:02:19.430 --> 00:02:20.530
Is this where I live?

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:34.050
It's the last photo we took together.

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:37.160
Were you here?

00:02:39.780 --> 00:02:40.400
I've been looking for you.

00:02:43.270 --> 00:02:45.530
The fact that my memories have been overwritten means...

00:02:46.760 --> 00:02:47.400
It means that you have returned.

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:50.540
I did it!

00:02:51.460 --> 00:02:51.740
Thank you for watching.

00:02:55.160 --> 00:02:55.280
Thank you for watching.

00:02:57.670 --> 00:02:58.330
What's going on?

00:02:59.080 --> 00:02:59.400
Naoto!

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:06.180
Takemichi-kun, in order to save your sister, you've made many time leaps in the past.

00:03:06.260 --> 00:03:10.590
But the future is the worst so far.

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:14.600
The worst so far?

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:19.200
Yes. Of course, your sister is not saved.

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:25.180
All the main members of the Tokyo Manjikai were killed.

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:31.720
You

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:02.120
Matsuno Chifuyu.

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:03.180
Shasatsu.

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:05.000
Shiba Hakkai.

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:06.050
Shousatsu.

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:08.040
Mitsuya Takashi.

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:09.150
Kousatsu.

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:11.010
Ryuguji Ken.

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:11.970
Zansatsu.

00:05:13.050 --> 00:05:14.010
Hanemiya Kazutora.

00:05:14.130 --> 00:05:15.290
Hayashida Haruki.

00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:17.770
All the other members were killed.

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:20.680
Even Kisaki was killed.

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:22.980
Kisaki was also...

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:25.380
...killed?

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:31.090
No way. Why?

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:33.940
The culprit is not caught.

00:05:34.260 --> 00:05:35.800
I don't even know where he is.

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:39.780
How about Mikey?

00:05:40.260 --> 00:05:43.370
Did Mikey get killed too?

00:05:43.470 --> 00:05:46.520
Please listen to me carefully.

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:54.180
The suspect of the serial murder is...

00:05:54.180 --> 00:05:55.950
Manjiro Sano.

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:03.710
Stop messing around with me!

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:06.860
That can't be true!

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:10.640
There's no way Mikey would kill everyone!

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:12.500
Hey!

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:19.390
I want to know the truth too.

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:22.920
I want to meet with Manjiro Sano and talk to him.

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:25.750
You're the only one who can do that.

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:28.160
Even though you're the head of the Tokyo Manjikai,

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:29.180
I'm a member of the

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:30.880
You're the only one who hasn't been killed.

00:06:32.230 --> 00:06:37.400
Mikey...

00:06:37.400 --> 00:06:41.150
That Mikey really killed everyone in Toman?

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:52.780
Takemichi, do you have any idea?

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:54.000
What?

00:06:54.970 --> 00:06:57.860
The information you got in this time leap,

00:06:57.860 --> 00:06:59.440
I'm sure you'll find it in it.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:02.800
There must be a reason. At least.

00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:06.780
The fact that you did something in the past has changed the present.

00:07:07.140 --> 00:07:10.530
The fact that I did something...

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:12.050
Does that mean I failed?

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:14.420
I...

00:07:14.420 --> 00:07:15.620
We...

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:18.620
We eliminated the two beings that made Touman go crazy in the past!

00:07:19.740 --> 00:07:21.060
We crushed Black Dragon!

00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:23.500
We were able to release Chisaki from Touman!

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:27.040
Everything went well!

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:30.800
What did I do wrong?

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:35.290
I shouldn't have said that I could do it alone.

00:07:36.710 --> 00:07:41.380
I only took this picture.

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:46.400
Akemi, where did you get that picture?

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:51.300
On the top.

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:57.900
The picture was in here.

00:08:02.590 --> 00:08:03.070
Can you show me that letter?

00:08:04.840 --> 00:08:05.860
Ah...

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:11.180
It's not from Japan.

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:12.720
Philippines?

00:08:13.820 --> 00:08:14.100
Philippines?

00:08:14.540 --> 00:08:22.280
Who wrote this letter?

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:27.560
Whose letter?

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:31.280
The place we talked about earlier...

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:33.160
Hm?

00:08:41.770 --> 00:08:42.250
A long time ago,

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:44.050
I found it after my brother went to buy the parts.

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:46.600
Filipino

00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:48.700
何とかってマジ。

00:08:49.770 --> 00:08:50.750
Mikey is...

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:07.660
This is the address that was in the letter.

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:14.860
It's a big place. Let's split up.

00:09:15.140 --> 00:09:17.260
Please be careful.

00:09:17.540 --> 00:09:26.370
There's no guarantee that I'm here.

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:29.970
If I see you again, I'll kill you.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.740
It's the first time I've seen you.

00:09:31.740 --> 00:09:33.680
It's the first time I've seen you in the future.

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:37.180
What's going on?

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:39.480
I wonder if it's changed.

00:09:39.940 --> 00:09:43.060
What should we talk about when we meet?

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:46.280
It's a huge ruins.

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:48.860
It's not.

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:51.030
There's no way it hasn't changed.

00:09:51.230 --> 00:09:53.340
You might be killing everyone.

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:58.660
The one here is not the Mikey I know.

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:01.020
12 years have passed.

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:02.440
It might be Mikey who has changed.

00:10:05.560 --> 00:10:06.860
I came here in a hurry, but...

00:10:07.930 --> 00:10:09.250
If I think about it, I'm in trouble.

00:10:10.490 --> 00:10:11.810
I might get killed as soon as I see it.

00:10:13.080 --> 00:10:13.380
No.

00:10:14.100 --> 00:10:14.540
He might have called us to kill him.

00:10:30.890 --> 00:10:33.190
Under the gray sky that looks like it's about to swell up,

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:39.270
there are a lot of scrapes in the ruins that have been destroyed.

00:10:39.290 --> 00:10:46.430
At that place we talked about before...

00:10:46.430 --> 00:10:49.530
There it is!

00:10:49.550 --> 00:10:53.770
The place where Mikey-kun's older brother found Bub's engine!

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:56.260
It's kind of...

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:57.870
Impressive...

00:11:00.020 --> 00:11:00.380
Kim Ik-ji.

00:11:25.940 --> 00:11:26.920
Subtitles by the Amara.org community

00:11:31.980 --> 00:11:32.780
Mikey-kun!

00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:40.620
The first time I met Mikey-kun, he had the same eyes as I did back then.

00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:43.070
Um...

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:48.120
I finally met him.

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:50.080
Um...

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:52.740
I finally...

00:11:52.740 --> 00:11:53.200
Um...

00:11:53.200 --> 00:11:58.300
I finally made it to Mikey-kun!

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:00.600
Um...

00:12:01.600 --> 00:12:04.280
I'm sorry.

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:07.230
Are you still a crybaby?

00:12:10.070 --> 00:12:21.410
I called you here because I have a favor to ask of you.

00:12:22.110 --> 00:12:24.010
What? A favor?

00:12:24.270 --> 00:12:29.230
Come here and remember your brother.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:41.340
When I was a kid, I had a lot of memories, and I used to fight with a lot of people, understand each other, laugh at each other, and cry.

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:48.620
That's how I grew up, and I got nostalgic.

00:12:49.180 --> 00:12:52.770
Mikey-kun...

00:12:52.770 --> 00:12:58.880
I was sure that Mikey-kun was Mikey-kun.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:00.680
Mitsuya-kun...

00:13:01.430 --> 00:13:02.350
There's no way I'm going to kill everyone.

00:13:03.930 --> 00:13:04.990
There's no way I'm going to kill that crazy Mikey!

00:13:10.550 --> 00:13:11.410
I changed my mind.

00:13:12.820 --> 00:13:12.940
Huh?

00:13:18.260 --> 00:13:18.500
Kimichi

00:13:22.140 --> 00:13:22.980
Why did you leave Touman?

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:24.960
Huh?

00:13:27.190 --> 00:13:28.050
I wanted you to be with me.

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:32.110
I wanted you to scold me like you did to my brother.

00:13:32.110 --> 00:13:32.470
What?

00:13:33.530 --> 00:13:36.440
I did my best on my own.

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:39.660
But I couldn't hold it back.

00:13:39.860 --> 00:13:42.270
The fact that I was going to die.

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:48.730
What are you talking about, Mikey?

00:13:48.730 --> 00:13:50.430
I tried to stop you from going out of your way.

00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:53.890
Kenchin said this.

00:13:57.930 --> 00:13:58.910
Stop it, Mikey.

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:02.320
Are you going to order me?

00:14:02.640 --> 00:14:07.810
I agree with Dora, too.

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:12.340
He's not fit for the future.

00:14:13.640 --> 00:14:25.500
Mikey, the path you chose is Shura's path.

00:14:25.700 --> 00:14:29.450
I and Mitsuya will entrust the rest of our lives to you.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:31.620
That's what I decided.

00:14:32.940 --> 00:14:36.930
But, Mikey, Takemichi is our benefactor.

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:39.210
I don't want him to be like us.

00:14:41.430 --> 00:14:43.050
Don't involve him in this.

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:50.510
Those two...

00:14:52.050 --> 00:14:55.220
Yeah, they're the best.

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:58.230
Those two...

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:01.140
I killed them.

00:15:01.140 --> 00:15:01.440
What?

00:15:02.770 --> 00:15:08.570
Aki, Michi, and Toman are no longer here.

00:15:08.610 --> 00:15:13.110
They were all killed by me.

00:15:16.050 --> 00:15:21.150
So please, let me finish this.

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:34.830
Takemichi, kill me.

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:50.940
I want to end everything here.

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:53.120
My dream.

00:15:53.440 --> 00:15:59.580
What are you talking about, Mikey?

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:03.450
Please stop, Mikey. I don't understand.

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:09.920
I just wanted to see Mikey.

00:16:11.340 --> 00:16:14.260
I just wanted to see Mikey.

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:14.380
I just wanted to see you.

00:16:14.380 --> 00:16:17.950
Did you say the same thing when you were about to die?

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:18.630
Mikey.

00:16:30.190 --> 00:16:32.030
In the end, I wanted to make a fuss with Takemichi and everyone.

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:41.020
Negiwa

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:47.230
It's hard to make a dream come true.

00:16:47.410 --> 00:16:49.470
To create a bad era.

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:53.590
I should have gone forward with Touman aiming for that path.

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:58.580
Before I knew it, I was in trouble.

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:11.640
When I first killed someone, I didn't feel anything.

00:17:11.820 --> 00:17:14.860
And I thought.

00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:20.860
Most of the difficult things in the world can be solved easily by killing people.

00:17:21.360 --> 00:17:25.270
You just have to erase the annoying things.

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:34.840
Mikey-kun! Mikey-kun hasn't changed! He's the same as he was back then!

00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:37.530
Stop it, Takemichi.

00:17:38.100 --> 00:17:41.780
I can tell by looking at him! He hasn't changed at all!

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:42.940
Stop it.

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:45.330
He hasn't changed! That's why...

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:47.790
That's why! Stop erasing things like that!

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:55.600
What's wrong with you?

00:18:03.960 --> 00:18:05.180
Is there anything you want to say?

00:18:06.010 --> 00:18:06.610
Chifuyu.

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:12.150
Do you remember Takemichi Hanagaki?

00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:17.580
I'll look for Mikey-kun and visit him someday.

00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:21.930
At that time, he will be as old as he is now, as if he has passed away.

00:18:24.350 --> 00:18:26.320
Please look at his eyes.

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:29.740
Look at his eyes.

00:18:30.730 --> 00:18:36.870
I'm not lying, so please believe me.

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:42.900
Don't look at me with your eyes.

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:47.610
Aiki.

00:18:47.990 --> 00:18:51.210
Pick me up, Akimi.

00:18:52.780 --> 00:18:55.900
Kill me or die.

00:19:30.410 --> 00:19:31.720
Pichu-kun!

00:19:31.720 --> 00:19:39.800
Aiki-kun!

00:19:40.040 --> 00:19:46.800
Karyo-chan!

00:19:57.170 --> 00:19:57.430
Aiki-kun!

00:20:17.080 --> 00:20:27.640
It's a lie!

00:20:31.920 --> 00:20:34.000
Don't say that, Mikey-kun!

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:37.630
I can go home!

00:20:38.010 --> 00:20:39.370
Kimichi-kun!

00:20:39.530 --> 00:20:41.320
I can go back to the past!

00:20:41.600 --> 00:20:42.720
I can start over!

00:20:43.260 --> 00:20:44.910
In this future...

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:48.380
I'll do my best so that you won't be disappointed!

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:51.130
I'll never, never give up!

00:20:51.530 --> 00:20:54.230
So don't say such a sad thing!

00:21:00.960 --> 00:21:04.220
You're the one who comforted me.

00:21:04.800 --> 00:21:08.250
Even if it's a lie, I'm happy.

00:21:30.190 --> 00:21:32.280
Mikey-kun, it's a lie!

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:33.970
Please answer me!

00:21:35.780 --> 00:21:47.580
Takemichi, from today on, I'm going to stand.

00:21:47.920 --> 00:21:51.750
That's why I'm going to create a bad era.

00:21:52.630 --> 00:21:57.340
You're strong, Takemichi.

00:22:11.930 --> 00:22:12.570
That's how it is

00:22:13.080 --> 00:22:16.040
I want to protect you, I want to protect you, it's painful
